  "headline": "Hvitserkr the Bold guide (God of War Ragnarok): poison and summon control for a consistent Berserker win",
  "description": "Hvitserkr collapses runs through poison pressure and summons. Fix the fight by prioritizing screen control: clear adds first, then take one safe punish and reset.",
  "keywords": [
    "hvitserkr the bold guide",
    "berserker",
    "poison",
    "summons",
    "vanaheim plains"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\nSummons break visibility and poison removes safe healing windows.\n\n2) Prep\n- Blades control for fast add clears\n- short runics that land reliably into groups\n\n3) Fixed steps\n1) when summons appear, clear adds first\n2) once stable, punish Hvitserkr once\n3) disengage and reset if the camera breaks\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- after summon animations\n- after large poison actions\n- after gap-closers\n\nRelated: use the all-Berserkers index for gravestone location and clear order.",
